WEBVTT

00:08:00.392 --> 00:08:02.520
However, I still want to believe

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.023
that my Papua New Guinean
cultural traditions

00:08:06.065 --> 00:08:11.612
and the Pacific’s Melanesian
greater worldview,

00:08:11.612 --> 00:08:16.158
based on values
such as kinship, relationships,

00:08:16.158 --> 00:08:21.830
and connectedness of all life
and non-life forms,

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:25.376
could be elevated
for solutions for humanity

00:08:25.417 --> 00:08:27.419
and for the planet to thrive.

00:08:27.753 --> 00:08:31.173
I feel that many cultures
and communities around the world